 "purpose": "The topics of the domain 'Getallen': place value, rounding, divisibility (with divisors, multiples, primes, gcd and lcm) and the number line.",
 "details": "Four Onderwerp subclasses share a cheat sheet (SPIEKBRIEF) through the helper base class _Getallen: Plaatswaarde (digit at a place, value of a digit, compose a number from place values), Afronden (round to tens, hundreds ... tenths with ROUND_HALF_UP), Deelbaarheid (yes/no divisibility rules, primes, number of divisors, gcd, lcm) and GetallenlijnOnderwerp (read an arrow, point out a number with zoom, jumps, thermometer with negative numbers). Everything uses Decimal. Each topic gives thinking-error codes, explanations and hints, and a repetition group in onderwerp_van_sleutel. Note: PLAATSEN here (power, name, abbreviation, up to millions) overlaps in purpose with modellen.PLAATSEN (power -> (short, long), up to ten millions) which the grid uses.",
